{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 60, :comments ["<b>Which you dreaded because of them.</b> Because of the plagues. When Israel would see the extraordinary plagues coming upon Egypt, they would fear them, lest they come upon them too. Know that it is so, for it is written: ״If you will diligently hearken, etc. … all the disease which I put upon Egypt I will not put upon you״ (Exodus 15) — one does not frighten a person except with a thing he dreads."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:42.698951427Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}